y":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-30T06:19:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T12:06:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.5.1, 4.6\n\nBut I also wonder if it's related to https://github.com/abarichello/godot-ci/issues/150, which was present in 4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21013.1000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm getting an error initially importing resources that have a custom importer *in a singleton*. I have some csv files set to load with the [csv data importer addon](https://github.com/timothyqiu/godot-csv-data-importer):\n\n<img width=\"247\" height=\"275\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1a5b99a-7bc6-44c9-a97f-4e6de91119ee\" />\n\nI opened the `.import` file to make sure the importer was enabled and noticed a path in the `.godot` folder:\n\n```toml\n[remap]\nimporter=\"com.timothyqiu.godot-csv-importer\"\ntype=\"Resource\"\nuid=\"uid://bd32ynsmpqx33\"\npath=\"res://.godot/imported/singleton_data.csv-1db633ec39e81e98ec83fe69f840e486.res\"\n\n[deps]\nsource_file=\"res://scene_data.csv\"\ndest_files=[\"res://.godot/imported/singleton_data.csv-1db633ec39e81e98ec83fe69f840e486.res\"]\n\n[params]\ndelimiter=0\nheaders=true\ndetect_numbers=true\nforce_float=false\n```\n\nDeleting `res://.godot/imported/singleton_data.csv-1db633ec39e81e98ec83fe69f840e486.res` (and `.ctex file`) causes the file to revert to translation on editor restart. Resources preloaded in a regular scene-level script do not have this issue, but this has been a complete blocker in setting up ci builds for my project. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set a resource to use a custom importer\n2. Add a global script that `preload`s the file\n3. Delete the related files from `.godot/imported` \n4. Chaos \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dec690e3-c7b0-4cec-80dd-077cdc0160e3\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24955647/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115618/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115618/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}